e pins. The only artifact feedback obtained explicitly rejects a candidate because its case_id differs from the selected problem. I cannot submit an artifact with an invented case identity or claim successful structural validation. This is not a mathematical proof-gap finding.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"problem.md and source-context.md identify the mathematical exercise, while check_artifact({\\\\\\\"spec\\\\\\\":{},\\\\\\\"graph\\\\\\\":{}}) returned ‘Case ID differs from the selected problem’. The task instructs the controller to bind spec.inputs and pins, so I have not fabricated those values.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Read the supplied documents and required Yui authoring/format/self-containment/logical/source rules. Reviewed the proof route. Its coordinate-ideal step needs a routine correction: coordinate submodules lie in C, not necessarily Q; finite generation and matrix-unit stability give a common rank-one torsion-free Z_(p)-module, which is free over the DVR and generated by one nonzero complex scalar. The remainder of the proposed route appears amenable to full expansion, including lambda=0 and p=2.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties